<title>USA: Campbell Soup Co Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Campbell Soup Co Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>		     Jan. 26, 1997	     Jan. 28, 1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 1.18	   $	 1.03</p>
<p> Net			    276			257</p>
<p> Revs			 2,317		    2,217</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     233			249</p>
<p>					 SIX MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>		     Jan. 26, 1997	     Jan. 28, 1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 1.51	   $	 1.91</p>
<p> Net			    364			476</p>
<p> Revs			 4,369		    4,207</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     241			249</p>
<p>Full company name is Campbell Soup Co.</p>
<p>Cost and expenses for six months ended January 26, 1997, include restructuring charges of $216 million.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
